        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 818SCE, San Clemente Single Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nModern styled design, the Kwikset San Clemente Handleset has concealed screw mounts for a super sleek look. By making something that have could been too simple into something that looks chic, the sleek design of this  handleset exemplifies the modern design aesthetic. The Kwikset San Clemente single cylinder door entry set is operated by key outside and turn knob inside. Backed by a lifetime mechanical and finish warranty the San Clemente handle is available for 1-3/4\" thick doors with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> the latchbolt is operated by a thumbpiece outside and grip inside. The deadbolt is operated by a key outside and a thumbturn inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-SH217-specifications.gif?v=1704354653\" width\"450\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Kwikset San Clemente Handleset Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <a href=\"/products/dummy-san-clemente-handleset-kwikset-819sce\"><b>San Clemente Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications & Features</b> for the Kwikset San Clemente Single Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length Overall: 17-29/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 13-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to Latch Spacing: 5-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Throughbolt: Adjustable, Min: 8-13/32 - Max: 9-11/16</li>\r\n<li>Cross Bore: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" doors.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed, Reversible for Left or Right handing</li>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.5 Grade 1 Deadbolt</li>\r\n<li>Anti-Pick New Advanced SmartKey Security</li>\r\n<li>Bump-resistant deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pry shield.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "San Clemente Single Cylinder Handleset, Kwikset 818SCE",
                "description": "Kwikset 818SCE - Modern styled design, the Kwikset San Clemente Handleset has concealed screw mounts for a super sleek look. By making something that have could been too simple into something that looks chic, the sleek design of this  handleset exemplifies the modern design aesthetic. The Kwikset San Clemente single cylinder door entry set is operated by key outside and turn knob inside. Backed by a lifetime mechanical and finish warranty the San Clemente handle is available in 5 color options.",
                "keywords": "KWI-818SCE Single Cylinder San Clemente Handleset, Kwikset 818SCE Kwikset San Clemente Handleset, Modern  styled front doors, Kwikset San Clemente single cylinder door entry set, kwikset signature series, kwikset, handlesets, keyed handlesets, front door locks, deadbolt locksets, key locksets, square single cylinder handlesets, square handlesets, modern handlesets, contemporary handlesets, Kwikset SanClemente Handleset,"
